  "commit_message": "Reject invalid UTF-8 and malformed whitespace in SignedNote (#3085)\n\nReplace fmt.Fscanf in SignedNote.UnmarshalText with strict UTF-8 and\nfield parsing matching the sumdb/note format.\n\nPreviously, fmt.Fscanf replaced invalid UTF-8 bytes in signature names\nwith U+FFFD (expanding lines up to 3x) and accepted missing or\nnon-ASCII whitespace, allowing unmarshalled notes to grow past\nbufio.MaxScanTokenSize and fail round-trip parsing.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bob Callaway <bcallaway@google.com>",
